obd2-instrument-cluster — attribution notice
============================================

obd2-instrument-cluster is a real-time OBD2 vehicle dashboard: a .NET 8 backend that
reads an ELM327 adapter and a React frontend that shows the readings as a
Mustang-style instrument cluster.

